        <mxCell id="_BMWQzA5p4reEyas-aQj-20" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Functional requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1. asking for ideas: people should be able to ask for ideas and vote if they&#39;re signed in&lt;br&gt;2. authentication &amp;amp; authorization: should be the easiest minimal way, either with phone or email&lt;br&gt;3. apps integration: other mafazaa apps should be able to use this project&#39;s authentication and user accounts&lt;br&gt;4. contact: there&#39;s an api for contact and our team can view chats through admin panel&lt;br&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;joining the team: people should be able to join the team using a form in our website, we should be able to see those requests to join through an admin panel&lt;br&gt;6. rating team members: every one submits the join form, we should be able to view these people, and give them status like [&quot;Approved&quot;, &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;outside collaborator&quot;, &quot;working&quot;, &quot;working very well&quot;, &quot;leader or head&quot;] and so on&lt;br&gt;7. we should be able to modify the content and testmonials through the admin panel&lt;br&gt;8. projects: we should be able to modify mafazaa&#39;s project and featured ones through the admin panel, and they should be fetched in the website using an api&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="_BMWQzA5p4reEyas-aQj-18">
          <mxGeometry x="10" y="15" width="370" height="345" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_BMWQzA5p4reEyas-aQj-21" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Non-functional requirements&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1. scalability: should be easily scalable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. availability: should be always available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3. latency: shouldn&#39;t be a bad experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;4. consistency: all data should be synced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5. calculations: normal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="_BMWQzA5p4reEyas-aQj-18">
